WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.030
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.030
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:24.970
S-Somebody!

00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:26.380
Jeanne has escaped!

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:28.540
Jeanne has escaped!

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:38.390
We're safe now.

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:40.720
We're heading north.

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:42.110
Where are you taking me?

00:00:42.490 --> 00:00:44.520
To a monastery in Saverne.

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:45.920
Who are you?

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:47.550
Why did you help me?

00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:50.660
You're a heroine.

00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:53.030
It'd be a waste to have you spend
your life rotting in prison.

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:56.470
In fact, there's a job I'd like you to do.

00:00:57.440 --> 00:00:59.490
Who are you exactly?

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:02.740
It's best that you don't know my name.

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:06.550
I helped you escape,
and you do the work I ask of you.

00:01:06.550 --> 00:01:08.450
Why don't we just leave it at that?

00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:09.550
Oui, Monsieur.

00:01:09.550 --> 00:01:10.520
Fine with me.

